From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Topher Campbell <chrs2021@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] leds: flash: mt6370: write the strobe timeout at probe

The strobe timeout register is shared between the channels. Without
this it holds the reset value, not the value sysfs reports.
---
 drivers/leds/flash/leds-mt6370-flash.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/leds/flash/leds-mt6370-flash.c b/drivers/leds/flash/leds-mt6370-flash.c
index 912d9d6223207f85961b36c9fdd6d32432af574e..e84ff9bbe3f62c0da24b212b17c3ae699b0329ca 100644
--- a/drivers/leds/flash/leds-mt6370-flash.c
+++ b/drivers/leds/flash/leds-mt6370-flash.c
@@ -500,6 +500,11 @@ static int mt6370_init_flash_properties(struct device *dev, struct mt6370_led *l
 	s->step = MT6370_STRBTO_STEP_US;
 	s->val = s->max = val;
 
+	/* The register is shared; without this it holds the reset value, not what sysfs reports. */
+	ret = mt6370_timeout_set(flash, s->val);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
+
 	flash->ops = &mt6370_flash_ops;
 
 	return 0;
